{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/95649ea6b3eb5f365667d708a5c6cf84.webp?t=1773142932\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zodiac Mountain follows a young panda on a journey through mythic Ancient China, battling fierce enemies and legendary creatures while climbing toward the title of Chinese Zodiac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Hands Combat</strong> - Build and combo cards across two hands: Yin &amp; Yang.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Turn Queue</strong> - Read enemy actions in advance and plan each turn strategically.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build-Defining Synergies</strong> - Craft unique runs by combining cards, upgrades, and relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Climbs</strong> - Face new encounters, routes, and challenges every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythical Enemies &amp; Zodiac Bosses</strong> - Battle fierce foes inspired by Chinese folklore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Mythic Setting</strong> - Explore a world inspired by traditional ink painting and legend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/190a799ef031db5f29678ca8478cd0a3.avif?t=1773142932\" width=1386 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield two hands at once: Yin and Yang. Combine techniques across both hands to create powerful synergies, adapt to new threats, and build a playstyle that feels uniquely yours each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/f36b850457ed6dbf0ffd6af78115a058.poster.avif?t=1773142932\" width=780 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/f36b850457ed6dbf0ffd6af78115a058.webm?t=1773142932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/f36b850457ed6dbf0ffd6af78115a058.mp4?t=1773142932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/caffea5fcc934dfa8a1a51c5137ccba2.avif?t=1773142932\" width=1386 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>  Every battle is a tactical puzzle. Use the dynamic turn queue to read enemy actions in advance, plan around incoming attacks, and make smart decisions as you climb through unpredictable encounters and branching routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/d40d247dc305164194c49e17e58c7295.avif?t=1773142932\" width=1386 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Zodiac Mountain, you\u2019ll get to explore rich tapestries of Ancient China. Enjoy stunning visuals inspired by traditional Chinese ink paintings and watercolor art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/f6d92f0777fcb794f30e7d0974fcf587.poster.avif?t=1773142932\" width=780 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/f6d92f0777fcb794f30e7d0974fcf587.webm?t=1773142932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/f6d92f0777fcb794f30e7d0974fcf587.mp4?t=1773142932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with intricately designed character depictions from Chinese mythology in front of procedurally generated mountains and ever-changing environments that provide unique playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2996150?t=1773142932","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/0a1cd14d586622c49c5c9f08034155c95c78cf06/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773142932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/7aa15b1b4e7522bcb64f2629fbbe5f38e9b49b89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773142932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/7aa15b1b4e7522bcb64f2629fbbe5f38e9b49b89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773142932","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3716490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996150/extras/95649ea6b3eb5f365667d708a5c6cf84.webp?t=1773142932\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zodiac Mountain follows a young panda on a journey through mythic Ancient China, battling fierce enemies and legendary creatures while climbin